{"id":"en_fu-shao-s-guilty-runaway-bride","title":"Fu Shao’s Guilty Runaway Bride","titleEn":"Fu Shao’s Guilty Runaway Bride","description":"Fu Sihan wrongly believes that Xu Nian is responsible for harming Xu Yanran, and this mistaken assumption drives him to mistreat Xu Nian repeatedly. As his cruelty continues, Xu Nian grows more and more disillusioned, until she reaches a point where she chooses to take her own life. Before that can happen, however, Qiuyang intervenes and rescues her. The story turns on this misunderstanding and the suffering it causes, with Xu Nian’s despair and unexpected survival setting up what follows. Audiences can follow the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fu-shaos-guilty-runaway-bride/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fu-shaos-guilty-runaway-bride/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Avenge","CEO","Chasing Wife Crematorium","Fallen Girl","Love","Redemption"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dupsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fu-shao-s-guilty-runaway-bride_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dupsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fu-shao-s-guilty-runaway-bride_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dupsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fu-shao-s-guilty-runaway-bride_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dupsk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fu-shao-s-guilty-runaway-bride_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumb